{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_027_02_a",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:13c83e2760bd2fd0f5c8bfd1c1f283bcc8e7298975ef132d665915093cdcd4e1",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_027yuk_02_1_2_027_02:1_2_027_02_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2dc979155eae682cf8206a994a318868c1a91fd7e9ed95290cbd3c9d32678f28",
      "text": "打造“难以忘怀”生日的方法",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_027yuk_02_1_2_027_02:1_2_027_02_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c2928955d9c03751c55dea9564fc9bc563e671293c9766c0080df1f433b59a92",
      "text": "幸广的生日马上就要到了。\n咲等人商量着今年办个怎样的派对。\n但是，幸广去年却忘记了自己的生日。\n既然这样，卷绪想出了一个绝妙的点子。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_027yuk_02_1_2_027_02:1_2_027_02_a:cmd-000026:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2b09bcd6e18d66980a219b2c252065efab172f9d4ca056860b35d17112afe537",
      "text": "第2话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_027yuk_02_1_2_027_02:1_2_027_02_a:cmd-000026:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2dc979155eae682cf8206a994a318868c1a91fd7e9ed95290cbd3c9d32678f28",
      "text": "打造“难以忘怀”生日的方法",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_027yuk_02_1_2_027_02:1_2_027_02_a:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6457d0a96e1dabbb7328fb501a3627a3dd1f4d17108ca56c7331d460bce5ad8f",
      "text": "马上就是神谷的生日了呢。\n今年要怎么办好呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_027yuk_02_1_2_027_02:1_2_027_02_a:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4b21967ae0b6ffdd01b94af6e4ef601b33b4f35843f8f9469a9fb3ec67d735e1",
      "text": "吾之同胞于暗夜中呱呱坠地之尊贵吉日。\n当大开宴席！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_027yuk_02_1_2_027_02:1_2_027_02_a:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:326bf8565ea67694ebbca23a97f4df542454f002a9ece2b3db31d81d22a321a6",
      "text": "是啊。\n难得一次，最好和去年不太一样呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_027yuk_02_1_2_027_02:1_2_027_02_a:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:007d534d077836ee6f9bba62eeb66f0ec63162c70d96f4cb58d2972ca608a53e",
      "text": "久等了，红茶和蛋糕准备好了哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_027yuk_02_1_2_027_02:1_2_027_02_a:cmd-000085:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f65c308200be4bf3d2d2fe891a5c42e2cbeeca71a53dcc4d49963fef748fff8c",
      "text": "呐，神谷！\n在自己的生日派对上，你有什么想做的事吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_027yuk_02_1_2_027_02:1_2_027_02_a:cmd-000090:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4cf05eea8ee968a6cb1c95a0f8091ef94c6167d12f708c2c26ea0c814bbb5a7b",
      "text": "生日派对吗？\n嗯，让我想想……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_027yuk_02_1_2_027_02:1_2_027_02_a:cmd-000099:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6a4e003f417d9986aced42487f59acc80e01f9ae23ccdb0177c57080ff5aaf50",
      "text": "去年大家为我办的派对，\n我真的非常开心哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_027yuk_02_1_2_027_02:1_2_027_02_a:cmd-000113:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:07699ea0d164c026568f0e5f5e58860b4189116a7cd65c0899f1e02d768944b1",
      "text": "那只是你的感想，算不上愿望吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_027yuk_02_1_2_027_02:1_2_027_02_a:cmd-000115:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:29c2a79d750d8cfe0ceaa14afd1f908e81fc8f48ab528bdf93bd455606a3dbef",
      "text": "……对自己生日的漠不关心，\n还是一如既往呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_027yuk_02_1_2_027_02:1_2_027_02_a:cmd-000120:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3b43e2212fe15e68a808b23d228aedca34b30cdf442a42f5dd9bb1e7993838b5",
      "text": "哈哈，或许是吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_027yuk_02_1_2_027_02:1_2_027_02_a:cmd-000138:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:201333eb9bc36d4e6c9c5ec36e1c0c9f35f47e49aedd06e3a028cb10db6b28ae",
      "text": "既然聊了这个话题，我觉得今年应该不会忘了吧……\n不过还是有点担心呢～。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_027yuk_02_1_2_027_02:1_2_027_02_a:cmd-000144:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:31742e2ddf92d21f38b1e24b07dd8d65785d337489942fb38303fba206db862c",
      "text": "作为去年忘得一干二净的人，我无言以对啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_027yuk_02_1_2_027_02:1_2_027_02_a:cmd-000153:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:eb3a52514e0516e5ff42a3be22fe55c9af624ddf03192127205ee0d9e289b209",
      "text": "啊！我想到了一个好办法！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
